        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 44 · AI Local SEO Monitor\nWeekly audits your local business listing / landing page for NAP consistency, keywords and review signals, with fixes.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 9 * * 1`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
    }
